    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> to allow injection of <code>Predicate</code> into Spring MVC\ncontroller methods.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.web.method.support 中的类或接口\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>，以允许将 <code>Predicate</code> 注入到 Spring MVC 控制器方法中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>conversionService</code> - the optional <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> to use, must not be null. Defaults to\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/DefaultConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>DefaultConversionService</code></a> if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>empty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>conversionService</code> - 可选的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>，不能为 null。如果为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>empty</code></a>，则默认为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/DefaultConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>DefaultConversionService</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
